# Cloudflare Tunnel Configuration
# Uncomment and set your tunnel token to enable tunnel service
# Get your token from Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard
# 
# Quick Instructions:
# 1. Go to https://dash.cloudflare.com/
# 2. Select your account
# 3. Go to Zero Trust > Networks > Connectors
# 4. Click "Create a tunnel"
# 5. Select "Cloudflared" as the tunnel type
# 6. Set a name for your tunnel (example: misskey-tunnel)
# 7. Get the tunnel token from "sudo cloudflared service install eyJ..." command
# 8. Add a route (example: https://misskey.example.com -> http://web:PORT)
# 9. Paste the token below
TUNNEL_TOKEN=your_tunnel_token_here
